    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Click <b>Add Recipe</b>.</li>
	<li>Enter the following recipe details:
	<ul>
		<li><b>Title:</b> Creamy Mushroom Pasta</li>
		<li><b>URL:</b> <a href="https://example.com/creamy-mushroom-pasta" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://example.com/creamy-mushroom-pasta</a></li>
		<li><b>Image URL:</b> <a href="https://example.com/images/creamy-mushroom-pasta.jpg" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://example.com/images/creamy-mushroom-pasta.jpg</a></li>
		<li><b>Publisher:</b> Arshed Md. Adel</li>
		<li><b>Prep Time:</b> 25</li>
		<li><b>Servings:</b> 2</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li>Enter the following ingredient data:
	<ul>
		<li>Ingredient field 1: 200,g,Pasta</li>
		<li>Ingredient field 2: 150,g,Mushrooms (sliced)</li>
		<li>Ingredient field 3: 100,ml,Heavy cream</li>
		<li>Ingredient field 4: 2,clove,Garlic (minced)</li>
		<li>Ingredient field 5: 1,tbsp,Butter</li>
		<li>Ingredient field 6: 50,g,Parmesan cheese</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li>Click the <b>UPLOAD</b> button.</li>
	<li>In the search bar, enter <b>CREAMY MUSHROOM PASTA</b> and search it.</li>
	<li>Again search <b>CreAmy MushRoom PasTa</b>.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result</b> : The recipe is found only when the title is search with the exact title capitalization is used.</p>

<p><b>Expected Result</b> : The search functionality should be <b>case-insensitive</b> and return the same results regardless of whether the title is entered in uppercase, lowercase, or mixed case.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

