        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to <a href="https://forkify.qa-academy.eu/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">forkify // Search over 1,000,000 recipes</a>.</li>
	<li>Creamy Mushroom Pasta recipe containing the ingredient Mushrooms.</li>
	<li>Enter <b>Mushrooms</b> in the search bar.</li>
	<li>Click the <b>Search</b> button or press <b>Enter</b>.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result</b> : No matching recipes are displayed when searching by an ingredient.</p>

<p><b>Expected Result</b> : For this ingredient searching have to return all recipes containing the searched ingredient.</p>
