        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to <a href="https://forkify.qa-academy.eu/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">forkify // Search over 1,000,000 recipes</a>.</li>
	<li>Open Chicken fried rice recipe.</li>
	<li>Check the ingredient quantities </li>
	<li>Increase or decrease the <b>Servings</b> value using the <b>+</b>  button.</li>
	<li>Verify that the ingredient quantities are updated.</li>
	<li>Open a different recipe.</li>
	<li>Return to the original recipe.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result</b> : The <b>Servings</b> value is reset to its original value, but the <b>ingredient</b> quantities ** remain ** updated based on the previously selected servings, resulting in inconsistent recipe data.</p>

<p><b>Expected Result</b> : The <b>Servings</b> value and <b>ingredient</b> quantities should remain synchronized after revisiting the recipe.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

<hr class='fullcontent'><br /><br style='page-break-before:always;'/><br />
