    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to <a href="https://forkify.qa-academy.eu/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">forkify // Search over 1,000,000 recipes</a>.</li>
	<li>Click <b>Add Recipe</b>.</li>
	<li>Enter valid recipe data and upload the recipe.</li>
	<li>Open the uploaded recipe.</li>
	<li>Observe the <b>Minutes</b> label.</li>
	<li>Click the <b>+</b> button in the <b>Servings</b> section several times.</li>
	<li>Observe the <b>Minutes</b> label again.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result</b> : The <b>"Minutes"</b> label is displayed with misspelling after uploading the recipe.Also clicking on after updating the servings also misspelling minutes label</p>

<p><b>Expected Result</b> : The <b>"Minutes"</b> label should always be displayed with the proper spelling, regardless of recipe upload or serving updates.</p>

<p> </p>
