    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to <a href="https://forkify.qa-academy.eu/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">forkify // Search over 1,000,000 recipes</a>.</li>
	<li>Add multiple recipes until the <b>Bookmarks</b> list fills the available page space.</li>
	<li>Continue adding more recipes.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result</b> : Newly added bookmarked recipes are not visible once the <b>Bookmarks</b> list exceeds the available page size because the panel does not support scrolling.Only accessible by searching.</p>

<p><b>Expected Result</b> : <b>Bookmarks</b> panel needs to support scrolling and allow viewing and access to all bookmarked recipes regardless of the number of bookmarked recipes</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

