    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to <a href="https://forkify.qa-academy.eu/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">forkify // Search over 1,000,000 recipes</a>.</li>
	<li>Click <b>Add Recipe.</b></li>
	<li>Enter valid recipe data in the <b>Title,</b> <b>URL</b>, <b>Image URL</b>, <b>Publisher,</b> <b>Prep Time,</b> <b>Servings,</b>  <b>Ingredient</b> fields.</li>
	<li>Click the <b>UPLOAD</b> button.</li>
	<li>See the bookmark of uploaded recipe</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result</b> : Newly uploaded recipe is automatically added to the <b>Bookmarks</b> list without user action.</p>

<p><b>Expected Result</b> : Recipe should be bookmarked only when the user explicitly clicks the <b>Bookmark</b> button.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

