    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to <a href="https://forkify.qa-academy.eu/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">forkify // Search over 1,000,000 recipes</a>.</li>
	<li>Click <b>Add Recipe</b></li>
	<li>Enter valid data in the recipe and ingredient fields.</li>
	<li>Open the uploaded recipe.</li>
	<li>Observe the available actions.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result</b> : The uploaded recipe does not display <b>Edit</b> or <b>Delete</b> options.</p>

<p><b>Expected Result</b> : Should be display <b>Edit</b> and <b>Delete</b> options for uploaded recipes.Allow to modify and remove the uploaded recipes.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

