    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to <a href="https://forkify.qa-academy.eu/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">forkify // Search over 1,000,000 recipes</a>.</li>
	<li>Click <b>Add Recipe.</b></li>
	<li>Enter too large <b>Title</b>,<b>{</b>}</li>
	<li>Enter valid data in the  <b>URL</b>, <b>Image URL</b>, <b>Publisher,</b> <b>Prep Time,</b> <b>Servings,</b>  <b>Ingredient</b> <b>{</b>}fields.</li>
	<li>Click the <b>UPLOAD</b> button.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result</b> : The long recipe title overflows its designated area and overlaps other UI elements, causing the page layout to appear broken</p>

<p><b>Expected Result</b> : Enforce the maximum allowed length for the <b>Title</b> field and the recipe title should remain within its designated area.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

