    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to <a href="https://forkify.qa-academy.eu/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">forkify // Search over 1,000,000 recipes</a>.</li>
	<li>Click <b>Add Recipe</b>.Beef</li>
	<li>Enter valid data in the <b>Title</b>, <b>URL</b>, <b>Image URL</b>, and <b>Publisher</b> fields.</li>
	<li>Enter valid values in the <b>Prep Time</b> and <b>Servings</b> fields.</li>
	<li>Enter the following ingredient data:
	<ul>
		<li>Ingredient field 1: 250,g,Pasta</li>
		<li>Ingredient field 2: 300,g,Chicken breast</li>
		<li>Ingredient field 3: 200,ml,Heavy cream</li>
		<li>Ingredient field 4: 50,g,Parmesan cheese</li>
		<li>Ingredient field 5: 2,clove,Garlic</li>
		<li>Ingredient field 6: 1,tbsp,Butter</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result</b> : The application doesn't show additional ingredient field after entering 6 ingredients.</p>

<p><b>Expected Result</b> : Need to display add more button when 6 ingredient fields are filled, allow to add additional ingredient fields.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

