    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps</b> :</p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to <a href="https://forkify.qa-academy.eu/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">forkify // Search over 1,000,000 recipes</a></li>
	<li>Go to <b>Forkify</b>.</li>
	<li>Click  <b>Add Recipe</b>.</li>
	<li>Enter Burger in the <b>Title</b> field.</li>
	<li>Enter <b><tt>://google.com</tt></b> in the <b>URL</b> field.</li>
	<li>Enter <b><tt>://google.com</tt></b> in the <b>Image URL</b> field.</li>
	<li>Enter Arshad Md. Adel in the <b>Publisher</b> field.</li>
	<li>Enter <b><tt>1</tt></b> in the <b>Prep Time</b> field.</li>
	<li>Enter <b><tt>1</tt></b> in the <b>Servings</b> field.</li>
	<li>Enter <b><tt>300,g,Pizza dough</tt></b> in <b>Ingredient field 1</b>.</li>
	<li>Click the Upload recipe.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result</b> : The application accepts the invalid URL format in the <b>URL</b> and <b>Image URL</b> fields and uploads the recipe with showing successful validation  message.</p>

<p><b>Expected Result</b> : The application need to display validation messages for invalid url fields and prevent the recipe from being uploaded.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

