    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps</b> :</p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to <a href="https://forkify.qa-academy.eu/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">forkify // Search over 1,000,000 recipes</a></li>
	<li>Click <b>Add Recipe</b>.</li>
	<li>Enter only <b>spaces</b> in the <b>Title</b>, <b>URL</b>, <b>Image URL</b>, and <b>Publisher</b> fields.</li>
	<li>Enter <b>0</b> in the <b>Preparation Time</b> and <b>Servings</b> fields.</li>
	<li>Enter all data <b>Ingredient</b> fields as required format.</li>
	<li>Click the <b>Upload</b> button.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result</b> : Recipe added to the system showing its information.</p>

<p><b>Expected Result</b> : Don't allow the user to upload the recipe successfully.Reject it for empty field in all the recipe data.  </p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

