    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <ul>
	<li>Go to <a href="https://forkify.qa-academy.eu/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">forkify // Search over 1,000,000 recipes</a></li>
	<li>Click <b>Add Recipe</b>.</li>
	<li>Fill in all required fields with valid data.</li>
	<li>Enter an invalid ingredient format.</li>
	<li>Click <b>Add Recipe</b>.</li>
	<li>Observe the validation message: <b>"Wrong ingredient format! Please use the correct format"</b>.</li>
	<li>Click <b>Add Recipe</b>.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result</b> : The user remains stuck after the validation message is displayed. Refreshing the page is required before a recipe can be added again.</p>

<p><b>Expected Result</b> :Without refreshing the page user get the access of add recipe. </p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

