<p><b>Expected Result</b> : stop the loading spinner after a short time and display the message: "No recipes found for your query! Please try again <img class="emoticon" src="https://jira.a1qa.com/images/icons/emoticons/wink.png" height="16" width="16" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/>"</p>
