    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps</b> :</p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to <a href="https://forkify.qa-academy.eu/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">forkify // Search over 1,000,000 recipes</a></li>
	<li>Click on <b>Add Recipe</b>.</li>
	<li>Fill in the recipe details as format.</li>
	<li>Click on <b>Upload</b>.</li>
	<li>That's take to home page</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result</b> : There is no logout option available in the Forkify application.<span class="nobr"><a href="https://jira.a1qa.com/secure/attachment/2817440/2817440_image-2026-07-23-12-24-53-699.png" title="image-2026-07-23-12-24-53-699.png attached to QATC-1011269">image-2026-07-23-12-24-53-699.png<sup><img class="rendericon" src="https://jira.a1qa.com/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif" height="7" width="7" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></sup></a></span> , <span class="nobr"><a href="https://jira.a1qa.com/secure/attachment/2817439/2817439_image-2026-07-23-12-25-09-777.png" title="image-2026-07-23-12-25-09-777.png attached to QATC-1011269">image-2026-07-23-12-25-09-777.png<sup><img class="rendericon" src="https://jira.a1qa.com/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif" height="7" width="7" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></sup></a></span></p>

<p><b>Expected Result</b> : Provide a logout option for authenticated users, allowing them to securely sign out of their accounts.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

